sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as React workspace
  participant A as Hono or Go API
  participant K as macOS Keychain
  participant G as GitHub REST API
  participant D as SQLite

  U->>W: Open local profile workspace
  W->>A: GET /api/github-profile
  A->>K: Read credential through fixed service/account arguments
  K-->>A: Credential stays inside server process
  A->>G: Request authenticated public profile
  G-->>A: Public profile response
  A->>A: Keep allowlisted fields only
  A->>D: Read latest saved profile
  A-->>W: Safe profile JSON
  U->>W: Edit display name and bio
  W->>A: POST validated editable fields
  A->>D: Idempotent upsert
  D-->>A: Saved profile
  A-->>W: Safe result without credential or stack

